  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A Partnership for Inclusive Prosperity / Paseria Ba Prosperidade Inkluzivu (PROSIVU)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A Partnership for Inclusive Prosperity / Paseria Ba Prosperidade Inkluzivu (PROSIVU) is Australia&apos;s main program for providing governance and economic development support to Timor-Leste&apos;s central government agencies and economic line-ministries. PROSIVU works with Australia&apos;s other bilateral investments, including on targeting blockages to service delivery, and working with Government counterparts, civil society and the private sector on priority economic reforms to grow and diversify the economy.</narrative>
  </description>
